{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Baby Journal 是一款專為新手父母而設的嬰兒活動追蹤 App，特別適合在餵奶、換片與哄睡之間忙個不停的家長。無須註冊帳戶、不連接雲端、沒有廣告與訂閱，所有記錄只留在裝置之上，並可隨時匯出備份。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-159.webp\">\n<h2>三下點按完成寶寶記錄</h2>\n<p>Baby Journal 把記錄流程壓縮到三下點按，餵奶、小睡、換尿片一按完成，大型按鈕方便單手操作。餵奶或睡眠計時可於鎖定畫面與動態島即時顯示，深夜無須解鎖螢幕。主畫面小工具直接顯示上次餵奶、小睡與換片時間，時間軸清楚列出餵奶時間、換片時間與睡眠總長，並內建深色模式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-288-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-32-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-33-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-34-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-35-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-36-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Baby Journal: Activity tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.741670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T00:31:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:57.374797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:12.736380+00:00","content_hash":"ce6304ce90b809054359e43c19ff806f6dfe868f8e84bc720d1b9d6ef0289e41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}